1. `tools/ui_lint.py` — Added `MIN_TOUCH` rule: fails any `Button`, `TextureButton`, `LinkButton`, `HandCard`, `LaneSlot`, or `ArtifactCardPlate` with a minimum dimension below 44px. Skips zero-area (invisible) controls.

